{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5dab75849f1aa15169fcda852b90bbd79089131efe3ae3b0bd6162ca0946122a", "ja": "貴音とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是与贵音出门外出的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak01_1000_008tak", "source_sha256": "1324cc5eb719f7855804c4b2985c3d914abe56030c00935f415399a47bbd282a", "ja": "熊本城は、加藤清正公によって築城された名城で、\n西南戦争の際には、政府軍の籠城戦の舞台となり……。", "zh": "熊本城是由加藤清正公修建的名城，在西南战争期间还曾成为政府军固守城池的战场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "53bcab73111f960d60856de9729121feb839355296bff3c4c0dc7441c29dd38e", "ja": "（旅番組のリポーター、しっかりやってくれているな。\n歴史好きな貴音にピッタリの仕事のようだ）", "zh": "（旅行节目的记者，做得相当不错嘛。\n这份工作似乎很适合喜欢历史的贵音。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak01_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "76f764c764b25d3624137c0a793ee5d3c5a55f8669201382f5ab43ca3a729db0", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまでした。\n……あの。何か、あったのでしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n……那个。是发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4c6a2a04b4589c9161c1e51ea6d83ca047f8339fb8661fb73d9c3306eae8e2ff", "ja": "お疲れ、貴音。実はたった今、オファーがあって……\n明日の移動時間前に、撮影させてもらえないかって。", "zh": "辛苦了，贵音。其实就在刚才，有个工作邀约……\n对方问能不能在明天出发前，先拍摄一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak01_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "15959298fbc35e1d798e58029f9d3143f363a235cead47a564f7a43c5cb19b4d", "ja": "明日……ですか？\nずいぶん、急なお話なのですね。", "zh": "明天……吗？\n真是个相当突然的安排呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0b1ec9ecd79d240d8c580428c44bf5546bd1647b7c30b8463c594678dcc76eba", "ja": "ああ。今の撮影を見て、ぜひ\n追加でお願いしたいって言ってくれたんだ。", "zh": "嗯。他们看了刚才的拍摄，说想务必再追加一个工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a495f89dd69c996fd9f135644f4534a9a7dac531338b2f9ef771f99f346e7f7f", "ja": "貴音の高貴な雰囲気がお城とピッタリで、\nまるで本物のお姫様みたいだったからかな。", "zh": "大概是因为贵音高贵的气质和城堡很相称，简直就像真正的公主一样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak01_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "6d4dcdb9d31b2c9b348451702e808effa03a4266af9bec433813a5c85d974f99", "ja": "ふふっ。では私が姫君ならば、\n{$P$}は清正公ですね。", "zh": "呵呵。那么，如果我是公主的话，{$P$}就是清正公呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak01_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "b45986a175525dadedbcea09e4aab142643905fb1ef61fda0ebf6ea1c6fde92f", "ja": "なんでも加藤清正公は、家臣を褒めて\nその気にさせるのが、とても上手でいらしたとか……。", "zh": "据说加藤清正公很擅长夸奖家臣，让他们干劲十足……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0752d18e735019ed9809e8a362e89f6202e77042bd1cb25a3b79156303e20645", "ja": "そう言ってくれたという事は……\n明日の仕事、引き受けてくれるでいいのかな？", "zh": "你这么说，也就是说……明天的工作，你愿意接下来了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak01_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "444a8d8e39a7eecc6f6af57c1806106b8db0977d3e384f81ed078d59f059993d", "ja": "ええ。私でよければ、よろこんで。\nどうぞ、よろしくお願いいたします。", "zh": "好的。如果您不介意由我来做，我很乐意。\n还请多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
